UNION & UNIONALL
Union and union all both are used to combine the resultset of two or more SELECT statements.

Union: 
Union is used to combine the resultset of two or more Select statements. and filter the duplicate data. and it is Slower than the UnionAll.

Eg:
SELECT EmployeeName
FROM Employees2024
UNION
SELECT EmployeeName
FROM Employees2025;



Union ALL:
Union All is also used to combine the resultset of two or more SELECT statement without filter the duplicate data.
It is more faster than the Unio.

Eg:
SELECT EmployeeName
FROM Employees2024
UNION ALL
SELECT EmployeeName
FROM Employees2025;
